        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Influenceur beauté fauché, Gabriel Rose rêve de devenir comédien. Mais il n’a ni le talent ni les contacts. Après un énième casting raté, il rencontre Stanislas, un fils à papa de la jeunesse dorée, qui lui propose de lancer une marque de bijoux. Gabriel y voit l’opportunité d’accéder au gotha parisien, où tout semble facile, en apparence… En parallèle, il se lie avec Pauline, une jeune chercheuse en écologie politique. Tiraillé entre deux mondes, Gabriel cherche sa place entre image et réalité, désir d’ascension, et besoin d’amour.",
          "runtime": 87,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "A struggling beauty influencer, Gabriel Rose dreams of becoming an actor. But he lacks both the talent and the connections. After yet another failed audition, he meets Stanislas, a privileged young man from the upper class, who offers him the chance to launch a jewelry brand. Gabriel sees this as an opportunity to gain access to Parisian high society, where everything seems easy, at least on the surface… Meanwhile, he becomes involved with Pauline, a young political ecology researcher. Torn between two worlds, Gabriel searches for his place between image and reality, the desire for success, and the need for love.",
          "runtime": 87,
